        "问题和习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "432",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "432．求证：经过平面上任意一点，有一条而且仅有一条直线，",
        "与已知的直线平行．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "433",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "433．能不能作一条直线与两条相交直线$a$和$b$中的任意一",
        "条直线都平行？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "434",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "434．已知直线$a$，$b$和$c$．下面的命题是否正确：1）$a\\parallel a$；2）",
        "如果$a\\parallel b$，那么$b\\parallel a$；3）如果$a\\parallel b$，$a\\parallel c$，那么$b\\parallel c$；",
        "4）如果$a\\perp b$，$b\\perp c$，那么$a\\perp c$；5）如果$a$和$b$相交，",
        "$b$和$c$相交，那么$a$和$c$相交．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "435",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "435．在直线的集合上，平行关系具有反射性、对称性和传递",
        "性吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "436",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "436．已知直线$a$，$b$和$c$．如果$a\\parallel b$，并且$b$和$c$相交，那么",
        "直线$a$和$c$的位置关系是怎样的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "437",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "437．求证：如果一条直线垂直于锐角的一边，那么它与锐角",
        "的另一边一定相交．"
      ]
    },
